# Used by `npm run build` (Vite mode "production"), e.g. the Netlify build. Safe to commit: every VITE_* value is
# baked into the public browser bundle, so never put a secret here.
#
# There is no API address here on purpose: the site calls /api on its own address, and the host forwards it to
# the API (netlify.toml redirect, or a reverse proxy). That also avoids CORS and https-to-http blocking.

# Optional "Contact us" overrides (defaults are in src/config.ts; set to an empty value to hide).
# VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=
# VITE_CONTACT_PHONE=
